    "title": "Authorities file charges against unlicensed contractors - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 hours ago Los Angeles County District Attorney Nathan Hochman was joined by Los Angeles County Supervisor Kathryn Barger, 5th District, on Dec. 11 to announce felony charges against five unlicensed contractors and to warn the public about unlicensed construction contractors preying on victims of the Pacific Palisades and Altadena wildfires. The arrests were made as a result of an operation conducted by the District Attorney’s Office’s Bureau of Investigation and the California Contractors State License Board. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
